\newlabel{fig:provenance}{{2}{5}{Schematic point-in-time evidence record with illustrative minute values, not measured holdout observations. The original endpoint, identity, and network observations carry distinct roots E, I, and N. The derived identity copy retains root I, a contradictory observation cannot support the relationship, and an observation made at event minute 60 but available only at minute 105 is invisible at the minute-100 decision. Event time and evidence availability are different fields}{figure.caption.4}{}}
